// Cowork validation — step 4 (only if nothing arrives): is the tenant receiving or rejecting OTLP logs?
// 4a. Discover which OTLP ingest self-monitoring metrics this tenant exposes (names vary by version):
metrics
| filter matchesValue(metric.key, "dsfm:*otlp*")
| fields metric.key
| dedup metric.key

// 4b. Then chart the log-ingest ones found above, for example (replace with the keys from 4a):
// timeseries { received = sum(`<received key from 4a>`, default: 0),
//              rejected = sum(`<rejected key from 4a>`, default: 0) }, from:now()-2h, interval: 5m
//
// Reading: rejected > 0 → payload problem (JSON instead of protobuf, wrong path).
//          received = 0 and nothing in step 1 → the endpoint is never reached or auth fails
//          (401/403: token without logs.ingest; wrong host; .apps. instead of .live.; Desktop too old).
